comment1.text=\r\n\ This\ constructor\ builds\ a\ hash\ table.\ It\ then\ fills\ the\ table\ with\ a\r\n\ bunch\ of\ empty\ records.\r\n\r\n\ @param\ capacity\ number\ of\ slots\ in\ table\r\n
